        <p source="#source-49767-49826"><choice corresp="#source-49777-49808" source="#source-49767-49808"><orig>Nara-sinha［＃nは上ドット付き］</orig><reg>Nara-siṅha</reg></choice><seg source="#source-49808-49826">-varman(630-668)</seg></p>
