        <p source="#source-49877-49909"><seg source="#source-49877-49883">Parame</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-61" snh:source-marker="c," source="#source-49883-49885" corresp="#source-49874-49877 #source-49888-49891">ç</hi><seg source="#source-49885-49888">var</seg><seg source="#source-49891-49909">-varman(670-690)</seg></p>
