        <p source="#source-50009-50042"><seg source="#source-50009-50015">Parame</seg><hi rend="accent" snh:accent-code="1-09-61" snh:source-marker="c," source="#source-50015-50017" corresp="#source-50006-50009 #source-50021-50024">ç</hi><seg source="#source-50017-50021">vara</seg><seg source="#source-50024-50042">-varman(715-717)</seg></p>
